[7.446, "o", "\u001b[2musage stats on — commands, agent sessions, token totals, account and install type, timezone and language, caveman-blocks commands and usage counts, and your IP address; never prompts, code, file paths, scripts, or names of blocks you wrote · caveman telemetry off (Blocks too)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.46, "o", "\u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m Claude Code: caveman_retrieve installed\r\n\u001b[2m→ `caveman wrap` will now compress streaming requests too (recovered via MCP)\r\n\u001b[0m"]
